From 949dfb2f53038f4694dc664c12bd664fe56163da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hapto <alex-88-3@hotmail.fr>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:25:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Tune MC/Onyxia/ZG timers from server scripts and combat logs

Timers cross-checked against tortoise-wow boss scripts and Chronicle
combat logs from OctoWoW (5 ZG clears, 2 MC clears, 2 Onyxia kills).
Fixed timers replaced by interval bars where the server uses urand().

- Lucifron: Shadow Shock every 6s (was 10-20s)
- Sulfuron: Hand of Ragnaros / Flame Spear intervals
- Ragnaros: Wrath window 25-30s
- Incindis: next Quaking Stomp + Fire Nova bar
- Onyxia: P3 fear 15-30s interval, chain from instant landing roar
- Gahz'ranka: engage bars + interval cooldowns
- Jeklik: no P1 fear bar; P2 Screech 12s / Great Heal 20s; silence 20-24s
- Hakkar: Cause Insanity CD counted from cast (20-25s)
- Hazza'rah: sleep/illusion intervals
- Jin'do: Brain Wash Totem / Healing Ward bars
- Mandokir: whirlwind interval

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WJLQrM2ob1poW3peUyML4T
